WEBVTT

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:05.238
At OCP, our mission is to re-imagine
data center, telco, and edge infrastructures

00:00:05.372 --> 00:00:08.608
to achieve greater choice,
customization and cost savings,

00:00:08.675 --> 00:00:13.813
and OCP solution providers play a vital
role in making that mission a reality

00:00:13.947 --> 00:00:17.117
by delivering and supporting
integrated solutions, providing

00:00:17.283 --> 00:00:21.021
local engineering architecture resources
for customers, establishing

00:00:21.021 --> 00:00:24.958
and maintaining relationships
with manufacturers of OCP products,

00:00:24.991 --> 00:00:29.029
taking part in business planning sessions
with the Foundation to better align

00:00:29.029 --> 00:00:30.230
with your company's goals,

00:00:30.230 --> 00:00:34.034
and of course, actively participating
in the OCP Community.

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:36.569
Interested in becoming a solution provider?

00:00:36.569 --> 00:00:39.806
The first thing you'll need to do
is become an OCP Corporate Member

00:00:39.806 --> 00:00:43.576
by signing the appropriate provider
agreement and paying the appropriate fee.

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:44.911
The next step is to build

00:00:44.911 --> 00:00:49.049
your product based on an approved OCP
specification or design package

00:00:49.215 --> 00:00:51.251
if you're a colo solution provider,

00:00:51.251 --> 00:00:54.187
to complete the OCP Ready
colo site assessment.

00:00:54.254 --> 00:00:59.325
Once you do, you can enroll your product in the OCP
product recognition program for

00:00:59.325 --> 00:01:04.230
OCP Accepted approval,
or submit your colo facility

00:01:04.230 --> 00:01:08.668
site assessment to our incubation
committee for OCP Ready recognition.

00:01:08.968 --> 00:01:12.672
When your product, solution or facility
has been approved, you can get started

00:01:12.872 --> 00:01:17.610
marketing your OCP Accepted products, integrated solutions,

00:01:17.777 --> 00:01:21.915
or OCP Ready facility on our marketplace
and throughout the world.

00:01:22.248 --> 00:01:25.752
By participating in the OCP Community
as a solution provider,

00:01:25.952 --> 00:01:28.788
you have the chance to bring greater
efficiencies to your customers’

00:01:28.788 --> 00:01:32.592
infrastructure, reach potential adopters,
and most importantly,

00:01:32.592 --> 00:01:36.262
contribute to reimagining our world's
IT infrastructure.

00:01:36.496 --> 00:01:41.534
Get started at opencompute.org.
